# Many people, interacting.
#
# Here the checker asks a third question: could you get this answer twice?
# Without a seed you could not, and then it would not be a model.

simulate crowd

    seed 12345

    agents shopper count 20
        patience starts at 10

    each turn
        every shopper loses 1 patience
        chance 1 in 6 : a shopper leaves

    run 12 turns

end
